===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*ōþ-}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*āt-||race, people}}.
Germanic cognates include Old Frisian ''ēþel'', Old High German [[uodil]], Old Norse [[óðal]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈeːðel/|lang=ang}}

